se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn an amusement park, dad and son Xiao Chen are in line to ride the roller coaster. The roller coaster has 30 seats but only 20 people are sitting. Dad tells his son, \"Most people choose to sit in the front row, a small part in the back row, almost no one sits in the middle.\" The son counts and finds that only 2 people are sitting in the middle.\n\n[Question]\nDoes Xiao Chen guess that there are people sitting in the back row before he counts?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before Xiao Chen counts, he guesses that there are 10 people sitting in the back row.\nB. Before Xiao Chen counts, he guesses that there are 12 people sitting in the back row.\nC. Before Xiao Chen counts, he guesses that there are 5 people sitting in the back row.\nD. Before Xiao Chen counts, he guesses that there are 15 people sitting in the back row.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.001700680926051591,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e196d6006945d27ffd60","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367894189,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:34","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"f8890c01dc954fe98e6baa63f9702b0a"}